  "nameEn": "Night Round of the Block",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Go around the block: on each side walk to an obstacle. Repair a sparking lamp and light it, light any other lamp, and on free tiles pick up whatever lies there. Turn right at a corner.",
  "descriptionEn": "A round of the block along its perimeter: sparking lamps, lamps without bulbs and items on the ground. One side is one \"While\" loop.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Go around the block: on each side walk to an obstacle. Only repair a sparking lamp, turn off a shining one, leave lamps without bulbs alone, and on free tiles pick up whatever lies there. Turn right at a corner."
